## 22. Formulas Quick Reference

### Convolution Output Size
$$H_{out} = \frac{H_{in} - K + 2P}{S} + 1$$

### Number of Parameters
**Conv layer:** $(K \times K \times C_{in} + 1) \times C_{out}$

**FC layer:** $(N_{in} + 1) \times N_{out}$

### IoU
$$IoU = \frac{|A \cap B|}{|A \cup B|}$$

### mAP
$$mAP = \frac{1}{C} \sum_{c=1}^{C} AP_c$$

### Apdex / Performance
$$\text{FLOPs (Conv)} = 2 \times K^2 \times C_{in} \times C_{out} \times H_{out} \times W_{out}$$

### Receptive Field
$$r_l = r_{l-1} + (k_l - 1) \times \prod_{i=1}^{l-1} s_i$$

### Dice Score
$$Dice = \frac{2|A \cap B|}{|A| + |B|}$$

### Focal Loss
$$FL(p_t) = -\alpha_t (1-p_t)^\gamma \log(p_t)$$

